    <sys:String x:Key="Tip_ReadAnotherPstkAComponent">Read another .pstk (a component) and put it above the current layer as a new layer: if the sizes differ it is centred, and its colours are mapped to the current palette. Afterwards you can place it with "Move layer content" or the 3D magic wand, then merge it down.</sys:String>
